  "doc": "The line version of the story hero pictures: pure SVG by code, no Blender. Everything numeric lives here: the canvas, the paper and ink colours, the pen (wobble, stroke widths, hatching), the unit proportions (w_over_h: the unit's drawn width over its height; norm_h: its height in a mixed row, as a multiple of the row's cell width) and each layout's frame. Heights are fractions of the unit's own height h; the drawing code holds no other constants.",
