             "doc": "Only the page's own colour variables: the ink for every line, the accent for the lit units' bodies and the leader mark (the one accent colour), the page paper (bg) under every fill so what lies behind does not show through; a grey is the ink at the opacity of its tint (grey/hill: the ground; unit: an unlit unit's body). No hex anywhere, so the page's palette colours the drawing."},
